i\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6 lit of Co</span>\u00ad<span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sub>2</sub></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> is required to create this pressure of 25mmHg.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8257]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>P</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup><strong>0</strong></sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> Trocar Insertion &amp; Safety Points:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8258]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Thinnest portion of umbilicus.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8259]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Vertical/ 90</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> insertion with the base of umblicus</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8260]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Introduce laparoscope</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8261]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Rotate 360</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> to check </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8262]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Any injury or adhesions</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8263]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Observe haemorrhage, haematoma</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8264]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Injury suspected or adhesion suspected.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"5c092b9f77bbc9c7124ef743\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-003\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 5c092b9f77bbc9c7124ef743\" viewbox=\"1304925 9525 323850 457200\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"bb93ff1a5705c6649df0c475f51349660bc7ff44aa57367dde1bd3cc710a128c\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"952e5a84d912dd7a87d1\" transform=\"translate(1333500 17780)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 276225 L 61912.5 276225 L 61912.5 0 L 185737