y Techniques:</strong></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"0519128a57b26edd1c5f42df\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-003\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 0519128a57b26edd1c5f42df\" viewbox=\"1619250 171450 57150 266700\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"8a687dfb1243499e246ab8851deb2722ec512da62327e6f94d7d0b198b2490d9\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"daed504d18bf367eff89\" transform=\"translate(1625600 184150)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 222250\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e5784cf22010bcff0c93f42b\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-003\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Palmers Point:Expected adhesions (23% in transverse incision and 50%  in midline incisions).3cm below left costal margin I mid clavicular line.Laparoscope 2 \u2013 5mm.C/I:Surgery in this areaSplenomegaly.\" viewbox=\"771525 28575 3086100 3343275\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"3d88a8cc7ca97d08b1109da6fd0f747c717ca4f8c7439a06cebd546f75441b5d\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-b0e652f1294452e95415\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-d4cd42b7894f6d1eb2e2\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"6dc8f0bb432c30292e2f\" transform=\"translate(1987550 244475)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1870075 0 L 1870075 3117215 L 0 3117215 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-tex